l_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p006:m0125","kind":"person","start":125,"end":128,"surface":"程殺鬼","person_id":"hlp_h2x_emp","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","interpretation_note":"依本完整來源單元具名與角色時序；逐項身份資格見identity-review。","paragraph_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p006","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangjin:p006","text":"時賊帥薛脩禮、杜洛周殘掠州境。孤城獨立，在兩寇之間，津貯積柴粟，脩理戰具，更營雉堞，賊每來攻，機械競起。又於城中去城十步，掘地至泉，廣作地道，潛兵涌出，置爐鑄鐵，持以灌賊。賊遂相語曰：「不畏利槊堅城，唯畏楊公鐵星。」津與賊帥元洪業及與賊中督將尉靈根、程殺鬼、潘法顯等書，曉喻之，并授鐵券，許以爵位，令圖賊帥毛普賢。洪業等感悟，復書云：「今與諸人密議，欲殺普賢，願公聽之。又賊欲圍城，正為取北人耳。城中所有北人，必須盡殺，公若置之，恐縱敵為患矣。願公察之。」津以城內北人雖是惡黨，然掌握中物，未忍便殺，但收內子城防禁而已。將吏無不感其仁恕。朝廷初以鐵券二十枚委津分給，津隨賊中首領，間行送之，脩禮、普賢頗亦由此而死。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","source_position":{"revision_id":2087998,"raw_start":11158,"raw_end":11598,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_character_offsets":[11158,11159,11160,11161,11162,11163,11164,11298,11299,11300,11301,11302,11303,11304,11305,11306,11307,11308,11309,11310,11311,11312,11313,11314,11315,11316,11317,11318,11319,11320,11321,11322,11323,11324,11325,11326,11327,11328,11329,11330,11331,11332,11333,11334,11335,11336,11337,11338,11339,11340,11341,11342,11343,11344,11345,11346,11347,11348,11349,11350,11351,11352,11353,11354,11355,11356,11357,11358,11359,11360,11361,11362,11363,11364,11365,11366,11367,11368,11369,11370,11371,1